{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-42"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815094-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"폐허가 된 은하계의 옛 성에서 고대 흡혈 괴수를 마주쳤다. 뜨거운 숨결이 내는 소리가 당신의 얼굴을 스쳤다…","talkId":403815094,"textHash":"6760064832795811494","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/talk-403815094","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"500ba593653a1b43","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815095-line"],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815095-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그 순간, 괴수들이 갑자기 변화를 일으켰다. 괴수의 피부는 단단한 순금에 둘러싸였고, 녀석은 변이로 인해 고통스러워했다","talkId":403815095,"textHash":"18221763378098783025","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/talk-403815095","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"500ba593653a1b43","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815096-line"],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815096-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"괴수의 축 처진 두 눈을 마주했다. 녀석은 수염을 위아래로 흔들었고, 그 뒤로는 녀석이 지키고 있는 새끼들이 보였다…","talkId":403815096,"textHash":"3517474075152535391","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/talk-403815096","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"500ba593653a1b43","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-6205296961037246967-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"그들을 「고통」에서 해방시킨다","talkId":null,"textHash":"6205296961037246967","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/text-6205296961037246967","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2bf952c9768165b0","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-13922691103957781331-effect"],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-13922691103957781331-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"선의에서 나온 행동이다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13922691103957781331","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/text-13922691103957781331","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2bf952c9768165b0","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-6205296961037246967-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-2208667844337841296-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"전투 진입, 승리 시 ★2 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2208667844337841296","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/text-2208667844337841296","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b0331a996e9130e8","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-pa